  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>South Walton's Gem<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Enjoy abundant sunshine, sand, and surf for your upcoming getaway to Inlet Beach! This rare gem is located steps from the clean and almost private section of Inlet Beach, within a short walk or bike distance of neighboring Rosemary Beach. Other great attractions worth visiting include Camp Helen State Park, Aaron Bessant Amphitheater, Gulf World Marine Park, Fun-Land Arcade & Snack Bar, M.B. Miller County Pier, and Grayton Beach State Park.<br><br><br><br>This beach charmer offers a spacious enclosed backyard with an in-ground outdoor pool and plenty of poolside loungers where you can sunbathe while reading a favorite book. Upon entering this abode, you will discover an open floor plan that seamlessly combines the living room, dining room, and kitchen. Spend tranquil and fun evenings in the welcoming living room, furnished with comfy sofas and a huge TV to entertain everyone during your stay. There is nothing like coming back home from the beach to enjoy a delicious homemade meal. The well-appointed kitchen has all the essentials to prepare everything that comes to mind. Attached to the kitchen is the dining room with a beautiful dining table and a large assortment of board games.<br><br><br><br>The first floor also includes a huge screened porch facing the pool and two spacious suites with an en suite bath each. The second floor features four additional bedrooms. The main bedroom is on this level offering a beautiful and sunny nook by the window, its own living area with plenty of welcoming sofas and a TV, and an en suite bath with a soaking tub, a shower, and double vanity.<br><br><br><br><b>Things to Know</b><br><br>Check-in time: 4:00 p.m.<br><br>Check-out time: 10:00 a.m.<br><br>All guests shall abide by the good neighbor policy and shall not engage in illegal activity. Quiet hours are from 10:00 p.m. to 8:00 a.m.<br><br>No smoking is permitted anywhere on the premises.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
